      "glvm.stack.items.6.text": "Tolang 描述并发进程；编译器将源码转换为 TVM 可执行字节码。",
      "glvm.stack.items.6.title": "Tolang → tolangc → .tox",
      "glvm.stack.items.7.label": "客体虚拟机",
